Package: llama-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgomp1, adduser, python3, ca-certificates
Suggests: python3-pip, python3-venv
Description: resident llama.cpp agent runtime
 llama-agent is a resident agent runtime built on llama.cpp. It provides
 host-controlled tools and capabilities, persistent memory and planning,
 bounded reflection and research, daemon operation, and MCP integration.
 .
 The package includes the command-line client, foreground daemon, MCP stdio
 server, adaptation worker/admin tools, optional QLoRA helper scripts,
 configuration bootstrap helpers, examples, and a systemd service. Heavy
 CUDA/PyTorch/PEFT dependencies are intentionally supplied separately by the
 operator through the installed requirements manifests.
